    "detailed_description": "<i>Ever wondered what <strong>To the Moon series</strong> would be like if it were an actual turn-based RPG??</i> <br><br>Well, here it is anyway. <br><br>For just fans of the RPG genre and fans of the To the Moon series alike, load up a save file that's already gone through the first 99 hours of grinding, and play (only) <i>The Last Hour of an Epic To the Moon RPG</i> straight to its conclusion! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664600/extras/a3dffb33042711b222adbfc84b8a3b0b.avif?t=1752512321\" width=370 height=168 /></span><br>Join the already decked out party of Neil, Eva, Roxie, and Rob as they venture the final Lighthouse-shaped Dungeon to defeat the mysterious mastermind big bad boss that await them at the top! <br><br>Solve puzzles &amp; defeat the mid-bosses of each section through majestic turn-based combat, using dazzling battle skills like...<br><br><strong><i>IT HAS THE JUICE</i>!</strong> (Eva)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664600/extras/85a95758e692a3f117c2eca2ed027739.avif?t=1752512321\" width=492 height=168 /></span><br><br><strong><i>ILLUSIONARY BLADE</i>!</strong> (Rob)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664600/extras/47a500b6320b135236da7c489408fbe3.avif?t=1752512321\" width=292 height=174 /></span><br><br><strong><i>TAKE IT TO THE FACE</i>!</strong> (Neil) <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664600/extras/45c3157f59c269365004cedb56a8fff7.avif?t=1752512321\" width=94 height=136 /></span><br><br>. . . and <strong><i>CATTLING GUN</i>!</strong> (Roxie)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664600/extras/bc4e3954ffcc596824bfd79f38403f90.avif?t=1752512321\" width=158 height=128 /></span><br><br>Featuring all major characters from the To the Moon series, as they fall under the curse of the enigmatic big baddie atop the tower. <br><br>What adventure awaits in their last hour? Who awaits them at the top?! And just why does this game even exist?!?<br><br>Wishlist <strong><i>The Last Hour of an Epic To the Moon RPG</i></strong> now! Spread the word now! Only <strong>YOU</strong> can help us not regret spending time on this!!",
